{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_195_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_195","textTraditional":"一、十有五年。春王正月，吳子夷昧卒。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_195_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_195","textTraditional":"二、二月癸酉，有事于武宮。籥入，叔弓卒，去樂卒事。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_195_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_195","textTraditional":"其言去樂卒事何？禮也。君有事于廟，聞大夫之喪去樂，卒事。大夫聞君之喪，攝主而往。大夫聞大夫之喪，尸事畢而往。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_195_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_195","textTraditional":"三、夏，蔡昭吳奔鄭。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_195_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_195","textTraditional":"四、六月丁巳朔，日有食之。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_195_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_195","textTraditional":"五、秋，晉荀吳帥師伐鮮虞。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_195_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_195","textTraditional":"六、冬，公如晉。","sentenceOrder":7}],"overrides":{}}